Package: kraken
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aegis <ops@aegis.local>
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Depends: ca-certificates, docker.io | docker-ce | docker-ee
Recommends: docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin
Conflicts: aegis-kraken
Replaces: aegis-kraken
Description: Kraken deception stack (app, sensors, broker, RDP, PostgreSQL, Redis)
 Installs the complete standalone Kraken microservice stack and a systemd unit
 that builds the images from the packaged source and brings the stack up at
 boot. It has its own database, Redis, credentials and lifecycle; it can be
 installed with or without the Aegis package. Docker Engine with the Compose v2
 plugin is required.
Homepage: https://github.com/Terminalkid09/aegis-ecosystem
